 "tier1Summary": "Estonia is shutting its border with Russia. From 1 Dec all three crossings close, after an arson attempt on a drone factory near Tallinn that [[p:Margus Tsahkna]] blames on Russia's [[p:GRU (Russian Federation)|GRU]]. Drones also hit ships off Romania, and NATO jets missed one crossing the Baltics.\n\nDiplomacy is now about Europe's seat: [[p:Jared Kushner]] wants direct Moscow–Europe talks before the next round. On the ground the front is near static, but the air war escalates: Ukraine hit the Crimean Bridge again and Tatarstan refineries, while Russian strikes cut power in Odesa. Gagauzia's governor race goes to a runoff.\n\nElsewhere, a third US carrier reached the Middle East, Iran claims more mine strikes near Hormuz, and the [[p:ASEAN]] summit opened in Manila ahead of Trump.",
